-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Excipient library sources
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Names follow USP-NF and Ph. Eur. monograph headings; structures are PubChem
canonical SMILES; 29 entries derive from the FDA Inactive Ingredient Database
(public domain). Incompatibility annotations summarise the corresponding
entries of the Handbook of Pharmaceutical Excipients (Pharmaceutical Press)
and are summaries of fact, not reproduced text.

